    "review_summary": "All 101 fixed-scope file hashes match. Reviewed the seven formal pages, the one implementation and three actual bindings, shared map, reverse weapon index, RAW and formatter comparison, and image receipt. The I–IV thresholds and charge interpolation match runtime. All three Lasgun P2 marks use the same charged-shot implementation, and the listed special sweeps default to charge level 1. Proc eligibility is held slot, same item, minion, and non-nil charge, with no ranged-only or positive-charge gate. Damage resolves before the proc applies rending, so the triggering hit does not receive the new stacks. The target debuff caps at 16 stacks, adds 2.5 percentage points per stack, lasts five seconds, and refreshes at cap; the helper stack setting is not the target cap. Holstering blocks new procs while existing target debuff time continues; true unequip removes the on-equip blessing Buff. The constrained armor example correctly distinguishes armor-specific damage from a final-damage multiplier, and the actual model names, bindings, RAW text, and icon 108 receipt are consistent. No issues found."
  },
